-- =====================================================================
-- 000_baseline.sql — consolidated schema squash (regenerated from prod)
-- =====================================================================
-- Idempotent: CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS builds the complete schema and
-- INSERT IGNORE seeds reference data (protocols + install scripts, protocol
-- variables/templates, translations, languages, roles). No-op on an existing
-- install. Runtime/secret data (servers, clients, metrics, users, api keys,
-- alerts, pools) is NOT seeded.
--
-- update.sh applies this in alphabetical order and records it in
-- schema_migrations; installs predating migration tracking are detected and
-- this is recorded as already-applied instead of re-run. New migrations
-- continue from 086_ onward.
-- =====================================================================

